<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1491477508"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:30.677"><div begin="10.310" end="32.682" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="10.310" end="14.985" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.310" end="10.908">传说在</span><span begin="10.908" end="11.215">伊</span><span begin="11.215" end="12.296">甸</span> <span begin="12.671" end="13.104">原始的</span><span begin="13.104" end="13.373">爱</span><span begin="13.373" end="13.783">没有</span><span begin="13.783" end="14.140">欺</span><span begin="14.140" end="14.985">骗</span></p><p begin="15.788" end="20.539" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.788" end="16.389">简朴过</span><span begin="16.389" end="16.580">每</span><span begin="16.580" end="16.913">一</span><span begin="16.913" end="17.522">天</span> <span begin="18.163" end="18.863">人们彼此</span><span begin="18.863" end="19.268">真心</span><span begin="19.268" end="19.608">一</span><span begin="19.608" end="20.539">片</span></p><p begin="21.255" end="26.218" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.255" end="21.676">心跟着</span><span begin="21.676" end="22.425">独特节奏</span><span begin="22.425" end="23.322">跳</span> <span begin="23.910" end="24.420">脸挂着</span><span begin="24.420" end="25.179">橘色嘴巴</span><span begin="25.179" end="26.218">笑</span></p><p begin="26.896" end="29.602" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.896" end="27.536">直到蛇在</span><span begin="27.536" end="27.967">身边</span><span begin="27.967" end="28.358">绕</span> <span begin="28.358" end="28.640">苹果</span><span begin="28.640" end="28.982">让你</span><span begin="28.982" end="29.602">咬</span></p><p begin="29.718" end="32.682" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.718" end="30.073">直到</span><span begin="30.073" end="30.591">起重机</span><span begin="30.591" end="30.849">拔</span><span begin="30.849" end="31.303">掉</span> <span begin="31.303" end="31.851">我们的独</span><span begin="31.851" end="32.682">角</span></p></div><div begin="32.742" end="43.909" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="32.742" end="35.326" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.742" end="33.248">可怜的</span><span begin="33.248" end="33.583">亚</span><span begin="33.583" end="34.014">当</span> <span begin="34.014" end="34.626">从此掉进</span><span begin="34.626" end="34.976">蜘蛛</span><span begin="34.976" end="35.326">网</span></p><p begin="35.533" end="38.082" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.533" end="36.034">为面包</span><span begin="36.034" end="36.389">打</span><span begin="36.389" end="36.756">仗</span> <span begin="36.756" end="37.394">先要学会</span><span begin="37.394" end="37.738">吃土</span><span begin="37.738" end="38.082">壤</span></p><p begin="38.338" end="40.893" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.338" end="38.782">朴实的</span><span begin="38.782" end="39.066">大</span><span begin="39.117" end="39.507">象</span> <span begin="39.507" end="39.871">进化</span><span begin="39.871" end="40.217">变成</span><span begin="40.217" end="40.565">四不</span><span begin="40.565" end="40.893">像</span></p><p begin="40.934" end="43.909" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.934" end="41.552">举头望着</span><span begin="41.552" end="42.295">⼋方</span> <span begin="42.295" end="42.917">低头忘了</span><span begin="42.917" end="43.287">思故</span><span begin="43.287" end="43.909">乡</span></p></div><div begin="43.918" end="55.609" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="43.918" end="47.218" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.918" end="44.386">⼈人都</span><span begin="44.386" end="44.782">各</span><span begin="44.782" end="44.904">自</span> <span begin="44.904" end="45.441">想登峰</span><span begin="45.441" end="45.983">插上</span> <span begin="46.093" end="46.524">⾃己的</span><span begin="46.524" end="47.218">旗帜</span></p><p begin="47.244" end="50.364" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.244" end="47.551">纯⽩的</span><span begin="47.551" end="47.971">鸽</span><span begin="47.971" end="48.114">子</span> <span begin="48.211" end="48.550">为什么</span><span begin="48.550" end="48.968">牠</span><span begin="48.968" end="49.163">像</span> <span begin="49.257" end="49.626">变成了</span><span begin="49.626" end="50.116">历</span><span begin="50.116" end="50.364">史</span></p><p begin="50.531" end="52.977" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.531" end="50.922">努⼒要</span><span begin="50.922" end="51.313">骑到</span><span begin="51.313" end="51.704">宝⾺</span> <span begin="51.705" end="52.023">买到</span><span begin="52.023" end="52.341">房</span><span begin="52.341" end="52.977">子</span></p><p begin="53.019" end="55.609" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.019" end="53.466">不过是</span><span begin="53.466" end="53.779">为了</span><span begin="53.779" end="54.355">让⻘蛙</span><span begin="54.355" end="54.836">能变成</span><span begin="54.836" end="55.609">王子</span></p></div><div begin="55.617" end="1:06.588" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="55.617" end="58.381" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.617" end="55.785">穿</span><span begin="55.900" end="56.477">灰衣的</span><span begin="56.477" end="56.895">姑</span><span begin="56.895" end="57.073">娘</span><span begin="57.073" end="57.242">得</span><span begin="57.242" end="57.691">不到</span><span begin="57.691" end="58.381">尊重</span></p><p begin="58.391" end="1:01.102" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.391" end="58.768">社</span><span begin="58.768" end="58.990">会</span><span begin="58.990" end="59.304">大众</span><span begin="59.304" end="59.654">不</span><span begin="59.654" end="1:00.004">在乎</span><span begin="1:00.004" end="1:00.384">微⼩</span><span begin="1:00.384" end="1:00.847">昆</span><span begin="1:00.847" end="1:01.102">虫</span></p><p begin="1:01.111" end="1:03.687" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.111" end="1:01.514">于是</span><span begin="1:01.514" end="1:01.846">⼀群</span><span begin="1:01.846" end="1:02.467">羔羊</span> <span begin="1:02.467" end="1:03.033">卑微的</span><span begin="1:03.033" end="1:03.248">愿</span><span begin="1:03.248" end="1:03.687">